      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like the weight of your pain has become so heavy that stillness feels like the only possible relief. If the struggle feels endless, that desire for quiet is incredibly understandable. Since the emptiness feels so absolute, I urge you to let a professional help you navigate this overwhelming feeling of finality. Please call or text 988 right now; they are trained to help people who feel exactly as you do.",
